<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10235] Cache registered in QueryManager twice if parallel caches start is disabled</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10235</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In case of disabled property IGNITE_ALLOW_START_CACHES_IN_PARALLEL callback that registers cache in QueryManager invoked twice which leads to impossibility to start cache if it was recovered before join to topology.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
